<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Revco lowered on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Revco lowered on price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Jonathan Ziegler downgraded Revco D.S. Inc to hold from buy due to the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- Said the stock has risen 101 percent since initial buy recommendation in November 1994.</p>
<p>-- Said share appreciation is now limited to risk arbitrage-type gains.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3/8 at 40-1/4.</p>
</text>
